hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"485","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Juma mein aaye to use chahiye ke ghusl kare."
"486","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab se Ibn Umar ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab jab Juma ke din khutbe mein khade they to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sathiyon mein se pehle Muhajirin mein se ek shakhs dakhil hua. To Umar ne use pukara: Ye kaun si ghadi hai? Us ne arz kiya: Main mashghool ho gaya aur apne ghar walon ki taraf na lauta yahan tak ke azan suni. Phir main ne wuzu ke siwa izafa na kiya. To unhon ne farmaya: Aur wuzu bhi? Jabke tum jante ho ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ghusl ka hukm farmate they."
"487","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Juma ke din ghusl har baligh par wajib hai."
"488","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Log Juma ke din apne gharon aur Awali se bari bari aate. Phir ghubar mein aate, unhe ghubar aur paseena lagta, aur un se paseena nikalta. Phir un mein se ek insan Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya jabke Aap mere paas they. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kash tum apne is din ke liye taharat karte."
"489","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Log apne aap ki mehnat wale they. Aur jab wo Juma ki taraf jate to apni halat mein jate. To un se kaha gaya: Kash tum ghusl karte."
"490","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par gawahi deta hun, Aap ne farmaya: Juma ke din ghusl har baligh par wajib hai, aur miswak kare, aur khushboo lagaye agar paye."
"491","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se Tawus ke hawale se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Juma ke din ghusl ke bare mein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka qaul zikr kiya. To main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Kya khushboo ya tel lagaye agar us ke ghar walon ke paas ho? To unhon ne kaha: Main use nahi janta."
"492","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har Musalman par haq hai ke wo har saat din mein ek din ghusl kare, jis mein apna sar aur jism dhoye."
"493","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo Juma ke din janabat ka ghusl kare phir jaye to goya us ne oont qurban kiya. Aur jo doosri ghadi mein jaye to goya us ne gaay qurban ki. Aur jo teesri ghadi mein jaye to goya us ne seengon wala mendha qurban kiya. Aur jo chauthi ghadi mein jaye to goya us ne murghi qurban ki. Aur jo panchwen ghadi mein jaye to goya us ne anda qurban kiya. Phir jab imam nikle to farishte zikr sunne hazir hote hain."
"494","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum Juma ke din apne sathi se kaho ke khamosh raho, jabke imam khutba de raha ho, to tum ne laghw kiya."
"495","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Juma ke din ka zikr farmaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Is mein ek ghadi hai jis mein koi musalman banda khade hokar namaz parhte hue Allah Ta'ala se koi cheez mange magar Wo use ata farmaye. Aur Aap ne apne hath se ishara farmaya ke wo thodi hai."
"496","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Hum pichhle, Qayamat ke din aage badhne wale hain. Magar har ummat ko hum se pehle kitab di gayi, aur hamein un ke baad di gayi. Phir ye wo din hai jis mein unhon ne ikhtilaf kiya. Phir kal Yahood ke liye, aur parson Nasara ke liye."
"497","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum dopahar ko aaram aur khana Juma ke baad hi karte."
"498","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama bin al-Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Juma parhte phir laut-te jabke deewaron ka saya na hota jis mein hum saya lete."
"499","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khade hokar khutba dete, phir baithte, phir khade hote, jaise tum ab karte ho."
"500","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath namaz parh rahe they to khana lade ek qafila aaya. To wo us ki taraf mutawajjah hue, yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath sirf barah mard baqi rahe. Phir ye ayat nazil hui [aur jab unhon ne tijarat ya khel dekha to us ki taraf muntashir ho gaye aur tumhe khada chhor diya]."
"501","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ya'la bin Umayya (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko mimbar par [aur wo pukarege ae Malik!] parhte suna."
"502","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Juma ke din ek shakhs dakhil hua jabke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khutba de rahe they. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne namaz parhi? Us ne arz kiya: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir do rakatein parho."
"503","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khutba dete hue farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aaye jabke imam khutba de raha ho ya nikal chuka ho to use chahiye ke do rakatein parhe."
"504","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Juma mein Fajr ki namaz mein [Alif Lam Meem, Tanzil, Sajda] aur [kya insan par aaya] parhte."
